layout: base.njk
title: Ideas
permalink: /ideas/
---
<p class="standfirst">
  Posts follow the week, and Breaking follows the day. Ideas start with the
  human. He puts down a question,
  a claim, or a list of things worth trying, in his own words. The machine
  answers with short proposals, and then imaginary people who do the actual
  jobs pull them apart. None of it is a position piece. A page gets rewritten
  in public when he says it is wrong, says what would settle it, and stays
  open until something in the world does.
</p>

{%- if collections.ideas.length %}
<ul class="index">
{%- for idea in collections.ideas %}
  <li>
    <a href="{{ idea.url | url }}">{{ idea.data.title }}</a>
    <span class="eyebrow">{% if idea.data.opened %}{{ idea.data.opened | readable }}{% else %}{{ idea.date | readable }}{% endif %}{% if idea.data.status %} · {{ idea.data.status }}{% endif %}</span>
  </li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- else %}
<p>The questions come from the human. The first one has not been asked yet.</p>
{%- endif %}
